 'OW-01':'Set up your business','OW-02':'Owner overview','OW-03':'Departments','OW-04':'Job positions','OW-05':'Position details','OW-06':'Position requirements','OW-07':'Members and invitations','OW-08':'Employee competency profile','OW-09':'Organization skill gaps','OW-10':'Digital competency framework','OW-11':'Training cohorts','OW-12':'Create a training cohort','OW-13':'Course preview and purchase','OW-14':'Practical tasks','OW-15':'Organization reports','OW-16':'Certificates','OW-17':'Checkout','OW-18':'Course access and seats',
 'MG-01':'Manager overview','MG-02':'Team competency profiles','MG-03':'Evidence review queue','MG-04':'Review evidence','MG-05':'Team training','MG-06':'Team report',
 'EM-01':'Learning home','EM-02':'Initial assessment','EM-03':'My competency profile','EM-04':'My learning path','EM-05':'My courses','EM-06':'Lesson and quiz','EM-07':'Final assessment','EM-08':'Assessment result','EM-09':'Practical tasks','EM-10':'Manager feedback','EM-11':'My certificates','EM-12':'Notifications and profile',
 'PA-01':'Platform overview','PA-02':'Organizations','PA-03':'Organization 360','PA-04':'Platform users','PA-05':'User details','PA-06':'Digital competency framework','PA-07':'Domain and levels','PA-08':'Standard curriculum','PA-09':'Standard course','PA-10':'Course editor','PA-11':'Question bank','PA-12':'Question editor','PA-13':'Assessment templates','PA-14':'Reference positions','PA-15':'Reference requirements','PA-16':'Course pricing','PA-17':'Edit course pricing','PA-18':'Orders','PA-19':'Order details','PA-20':'Audit log','PA-21':'Platform settings'
