 'OW-17':['Only paid courses enter checkout.','Basic access costs nothing; the cart contains higher levels and their seats.','OW-18'],
 'OW-18':['Free access and paid seats are distinct.','Basic remains available to the business; paid courses show purchased, used and open seats.','OW-12'],
 'MG-01':['Your team capability, person by person.','Read six domains and 24 competencies before acting on the review queue.','MG-02'],
