 'MG-06':['Use reports to intervene early.','Filter by position and inspect the people behind each rate.','MG-02'],
 'PA-01':['Keep standards and customers moving.','Watch draft content, organization support and sensitive changes in one place.','PA-08'],
 'PA-02':['Find an organization in context.','Status, Owner and access history lead to a single 360 view.','PA-03'],
 'PA-03':['Support should leave a trace.','Inspect history before changing access or organization status.','PA-20'],
 'PA-04':['Find users across organizations.','Search by email, role and status while retaining organization context.','PA-05'],
 'PA-05':['History comes before a sensitive action.','Show roles and recent events before recovery or suspension.','PA-20'],
 'PA-06':['One shared digital standard.','Publish six domains and 24 competencies with clear version history.','PA-07'],
 'PA-07':['Understand each competency and level.','Use the framework code and level mapping to guide course design.','PA-08'],
 'PA-08':['Eighteen courses, one release lifecycle.','The six Basic courses are free; twelve higher level courses are paid.','PA-09'],
 'PA-09':['A course has a published version.','See lessons, assessments and the active release.','PA-10'],
 'PA-10':['Edit simply, preview carefully.','Review learning material before publishing a new version.','PA-09'],
 'PA-11':['Question coverage matters more than volume.','Filter by competency, level and item type.','PA-12'],
 'PA-12':['Write the explanation with the answer.','Connect the scenario and rationale to the correct competency.','PA-11'],
 'PA-13':['Balance the assessment blueprint.','Preview coverage, question count and pass threshold.','PA-11'],
 'PA-14':['Reference positions speed up setup.','Businesses copy a reference and adapt it to their work.','PA-15'],
 'PA-15':['A reference requirement can be inspected.','Set targets for each competency and preview the changed version.','PA-14'],
